<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S. Bernstein on Hershey, Wrigley.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S. Bernstein on Hershey, Wrigley.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Sanford Bernstein analyst Steve Galbraith said he downgraded Hershey Foods Corp to sell from hold, and upgraded Wm. Wrigley Jr Co to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- cited stock prices.</p>
<p>-- also noted that Hershey has increased prices last year, while Wrigley has not raised its prices since 1987, &quot;and it may be looking to make one in the next 12 to 18 months.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Hershey fell 1-3/4 to 56-5/8, while Wrigley shares gained 5/8 to 59-1/8.</p>
</text>
